# Workflow

Registry & playbooks: `skills/SKILLS-REGISTRY.md`, `skills/CONVENTIONS.md`. **Rules below use rule IDs**; detailed steps live in the matching **skill ID** (invoke-skill).

**With question-scope:** L1–L4 gates and `docs/work/…` come from **`question-scope`**; supplement map: **`question-scope`** → `references/superpowers-supplement.md`. This file does not replace scope level choice. When scope is active, **level + supplement table override** the feature flow and hard gates below (e.g. L2 skips design/plan; L3 default execute is **B**).

